@startuml activity-recognition
title Activity diagram: requesting recognition

|Student|
start
:Check progress towards recognition;
|Ayni|
:Compare verified hours taught and rating\nagainst the university rule;
if (Criteria met?) then (no)
  :Show remaining hours;
  |Student|
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|Student|
:Submit recognition request;
|Ayni|
:Freeze hours, sessions count and average rating;
:Link backing sessions\n(a session backs one request only);
:Publish RecognitionRequested;
|Coordinator|
:Open request from the queue;
|Ayni|
:Mark UNDER_REVIEW;
:Show file: sessions, attendance,\nratings and audit anomalies;
|Coordinator|
if (Approve?) then (yes)
  :Approve with a reason;
else (no)
  :Reject with a reason;
endif
|Ayni|
:Record decision;
:Publish RecognitionResolved;
:Notify the student;
note right: credits are never consumed
stop
@enduml
